  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delivering the London Jordan Conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delivering the London Jordan Conference will be a key activity to help achieve the objectives outlined in the UK-Jordan Partnership.  This Partnership offers a long-term UK commitment to support Jordan to protect its borders, deliver economic, social and political resilience, improve education and empower the private sector to deliver jobs.  The Conference will engage the international community and private sector around a clear agenda to increase Jordan&#x2019;s economic resilience and create jobs for Jordan&#x2019;s youth and future generations.</narrative>
  </description>
